{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"a large salmon statue (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a student magazine hypothesised what would happen if <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rakaia_salmon_statue\" title=\"Rakaia salmon statue\">a large salmon statue</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> fought a trout statue in New Zealand?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rakaia_salmon_statue","retrieved":1782808825507},{"title":"Indonesian Painters Association (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that although the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Indonesian_Painters_Association\" title=\"Indonesian Painters Association\">Indonesian Painters Association</a></b> sought to develop a modern Indonesian art, its members had no shared style?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indonesian_Painters_Association","retrieved":1782808825507},{"title":"Edgar J. March (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that while writer <b><a href=\"/wiki/Edgar_J._March\" title=\"Edgar J. March\">Edgar J. March</a></b> served as a war reserve constable during World War&nbsp;II, he tussled with a burglar and chased him on a borrowed bicycle?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgar_J._March","retrieved":1782808825507},{"title":"premise (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a faulty <b><a href=\"/wiki/Premise\" title=\"Premise\">premise</a></b> can turn a whole argument into a fallacy?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Premise","retrieved":1782808825508},{"title":"the musical adaptation of Black Swan (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Swan_(musical)\" title=\"Black Swan (musical)\">the musical adaptation of <i>Black Swan</i></a></b> rewrote the character of Thomas LeRoy as a woman to avoid writing a #MeToo story?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Swan_(musical)","retrieved":1782808825508},{"title":"Salvation Army Memorial Temple (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Philadelphia's <b><a href=\"/wiki/Park_Theatre_(Philadelphia,_Broad_St.)\" title=\"Park Theatre (Philadelphia, Broad St.)\">Salvation Army Memorial Temple</a></b> was once an American burlesque theatre?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Park_Theatre_(Philadelphia,_Broad_St.)","retrieved":1782808825508},{"title":"A Story About Fire (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/A_Story_About_Fire\" title=\"A Story About Fire\">A Story About Fire</a></b></i> was animated by hand on 50,000&nbsp;sheets of rice paper?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Story_About_Fire","retrieved":1782808825549},{"title":"Soonish (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the authors of <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Soonish\" title=\"Soonish\">Soonish</a></b></i> had to remove a completed chapter from the book before publication?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soonish","retrieved":1782808825549},{"title":"Haffen Park (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a large yellow bear taught 500&nbsp;children how to wash their hands in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Haffen_Park\" title=\"Haffen Park\">Haffen Park</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haffen_Park","retrieved":1782808825550},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Galway&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;GalwayBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Castles and other grand buildings in grey rock, pubs, small patches of greenery and Gaelic games - much of what Ireland is famous for awaits you in the country's fourt